    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timeline-based auto chess game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique equipment effect design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about it in each game and create your unique equipment combination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel with enemies who also have various special equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well-polished game mechanism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discard all complex extraneous factors and strive for immersive enjoyment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure small-scale battle fun, fighting is enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to focus on is making money, buying equipment, matching entries, and then winning the next victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique engine building system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is the main body, and each piece of equipment has its own unique entry effect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy in the store at the end of each game, then strip and fuse your entries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build offensive weapons or indestructible armor, or both</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timeline-based auto chess game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique equipment effect design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about it in each game and create your unique equipment combination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel with enemies who also have various special equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well-polished game mechanism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discard all complex extraneous factors and strive for immersive enjoyment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure small-scale battle fun, fighting is enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to focus on is making money, buying equipment, matching entries, and then winning the next victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique engine building system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is the main body, and each piece of equipment has its own unique entry effect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy in the store at the end of each game, then strip and fuse your entries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build offensive weapons or indestructible armor, or both</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aThe Grafted Gear\u300bis an auto chess game that focuses on engine building. In each game, you will get a large number of equipment with unique entries and designs, facing enemies with unique designs. In the rest between each battle, you will build your equipment, and build a unique equipment engine.",
